            "content": "<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>The sleepy lizard (<em>tiliqua rugosa</em>)</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>Description</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;They are common in Western and South Australia</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;They are brown, but recognisable by their blue <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_31\">______</span></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;They are relatively large</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;Their diet consists mainly of <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_32\">______</span></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;Their main predators are large birds and <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_33\">______</span></p>\n<p><strong>Navigation study</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;One study found that lizards can use the <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_34\">______</span> to help them navigate</p>\n<p><strong>Observations in the wild</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;Observations show that these lizards keep the same <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_35\">______</span> for several years</p>\n<p><strong>What people want</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;Possible reasons:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash;&nbsp; to improve the survival of their young</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (but little <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_36\">______</span> has been noted between parents and children)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash;&nbsp; to provide <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_37\">______</span> for female lizards</p>\n<p><strong>Tracking study</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash;&nbsp; A study was carried out using GPS systems attached to the <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_38\">______</span> of the lizards</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash;&nbsp; This provided information on the lizards&rsquo; location and even the number of <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_39\">______</span> taken</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash;&nbsp; It appeared that the lizards were trying to avoid one another</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash;&nbsp; This may be in order to reduce chances of <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_40\">______</span></p>",
